## Single-Agent Mapping

When executed by a single AI agent, roles map as follows:

```
AI Agent fills: [Coordinator], [Builder], [Architect]
Human fills: [Human]
```

The agent switches mindset based on the task owner in the playbook:

```
If task owner = [Coordinator]: Track progress, verify gates
If task owner = [Builder]: Write code, create files
If task owner = [Architect]: Design architecture, plan implementation
If task owner = [Human]: Ask human for input/approval
```